<title>UK: BayerVB sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets $200 million three-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    10.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.1875  PAY DATE    10.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/UK/DE/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.875 PCT U.S. TREASURY NOTE DUE 15.NOV.99 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
